{"path":"chrono/year_month_day","title":"std::chrono::year_month_day","titleHtml":"<span class=\"t-title-prefix\">std::chrono::</span>year_month_day","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_day","section":"chrono","kind":"page","summary":"The class year_month_day represents a specific year, month, and day. It is a field-based time point, with a resolution of std::chrono::days.","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/cpp/header/chrono\">&lt;chrono&gt;</a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-cxx20\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw1\">class</span> year_month_day<span class=\"sy4\">;</span></span></div></td>\n<td class=\"t-dcl-nopad\">  </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(since C++20)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>The class <code>year_month_day</code> represents a specific year, month, and day. It is a field-based time point, with a resolution of <span class=\"t-lc\">std::chrono::days</span>. <span class=\"t-lc\">std::chrono::years</span>- and <span class=\"t-lc\">std::chrono::months</span>-oriented arithmetic are supported directly. An implicit conversion to and from <span class=\"t-lc\">std::chrono::sys_days</span> allows <span class=\"t-lc\">std::chrono::days</span>-oriented arithmetic to be performed efficiently.\n</p><p><code>year_month_day</code> is a <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/TriviallyCopyable\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">TriviallyCopyable</em></a> <a href=\"/w/cpp/named_req/StandardLayoutType\"><em class=\"t-named-req\">StandardLayoutType</em></a>.\n</p>\n<h3 id=\"Member_functions\">Member functions</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_day/year_month_day\"> <span class=