an><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  compares two <code>year_month_day</code> values <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_day/operator_arith_2\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator+</span><span>operator-</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  adds or subtracts a <code>year_month_day</code> and some number of years or months <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_day/operator_ltlt\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>operator&lt;&lt;</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  outputs a <code>year_month_day</code> into a stream <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_day/from_stream\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>from_stream</span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-cxx20\">(C++20)</span></span></span></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  parses a <code>year_month_day</code> from a stream according to the provided format <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(function template)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>\n<h3 id=\"Helper_classes\">Helper classes</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/chrono/year_month_day/formatter\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>std::formatter<span class=\"t-dsc-small\">&lt;std::chrono::year_month_day&gt;</span></span></span></a></div><div><span class=\"t-lines\"><span><span class=\"t-mark-rev t-si